	)
	(text "VBAT_SENSE = VBAT x 27k / 127k = 0.2126 VBAT\n(12.6 V -> 2.68 V, 13.5 V -> 2.87 V < VDDA).\nSource 21.3 kOhm < 50 kOhm R_AIN max; C103 100 nF\n>> 20 x 5 pF C_ADC, tau 2.1 ms (DS11929 Table 73).\n+/-1.57 % ratio error with 1 % parts:\ncalibrate per board against VREFINT."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 193.04 110.49 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "88adceb4-1a60-5c3c-8d8b-b032bf5921be")
	)
	(text "J101 XT30: 3S LiPo, 9.0-12.6 V, pad 1 = +.  F101 4 A fast, 300 A at 24 V breaking capacity.\nQ101 AO4805 (D-011): FET A (drain to the battery) blocks a reversed pack; FET B switches the load.\nSW101 on: R102 pulls PP_G low, V_GS = -VBAT/2 (-4.5 V at 9.0 V, -6.8 V at 13.5 V); D101 keeps |V_GS| < 20 V.\nSW101 off: R101 holds the gates off; C102 limits the hot-plug V_GS step to -0.57 V (< |V_th| 1.0 V) (S1).\nSoft start (D-021): R103 + C101 Miller integrator, ~1.7 V/ms, inrush ~0.5 A for ~7 ms (S1); turn-off tau 105 ms.\nD102 SMBJ15A after the FETs: V_RWM 15 V > 13.5 V, V_C 24.4 V < 30 V (AO4805) and 32 V (TPS62933).\nIt must never sit before the FETs: a reversed pack would forward-bias it through the fuse."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 118.11 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c364a150-6f49-58f1-a74d-079a8b62fe8e")
	)
